-- 1. INVOKER view query is cached: one entry
1	10
2	20
-- entries: 1
-- 2. MODIFY SQL SECURITY NONE: the next run fails validation and evicts the entry
1	10
2	20
-- entries: 0
-- bytes are zero: 1
-- 3. repeated runs stay uncached
1	10
2	20
-- entries: 0
-- 4. schema change on a plain table: the stale entry is replaced, not leaked
2
-- entries: 1
2
-- entries: 1
